{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RPG One Player game with turn based battle system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this spine-chilling indie horror game, players will step into the shoes of Hasumi, a brave and determined protagonist lost in the eerie and enigmatic world of Limbo. In a race against time to rescue your sister, Kioko, from the clutches of the malevolent Akumu, you will encounter and help other lost souls while engaging in turn-based battles with the Shinigami who lurk in Limbo.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect amulets and objects to use in battle while helping other lost souls move on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you prevail?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3481640?t=1742134353","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481640/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742134353","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481640/eda5801d4c9bf4201c45f37c4f91aea4cbd9945e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742134353","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481640/eda5801d4c9bf4201c45f37c4f91aea4cbd9945e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742134353","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game features horror elements and disturbing imagery that may not be suitable for all players."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RPG One Player game with turn based battle system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this spine-chilling indie horror game, players will step into the shoes of Hasumi, a brave and determined protagonist lost in the eerie and enigmatic world of Limbo. In a race against time to rescue your sister, Kioko, from the clutches of the malevolent Akumu, you will encounter and help other